    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2233320/extras/1b5bb2dc12c9a2b96c8ba90448d7133a.avif?t=1671314091\" /></div><br><br>Starting with the basic info - You move with WASD , Slow motion is SHIFT and Dashing is with Q/E. Use W to activate your jetpack.<br><br>You are playing a blue robot who's been scammed to kill his own kind by a blue evil hologram named &quot;Ding&quot;, You will have to kill every single one of your robot kind until you reach the end where you discover the cruel truth.<br><br>What are you going to see in the game ? You will have to defeat hundreds of enemies , using 3 main tools , your Slow motion effect , Your jetpack and dashing. <br>In each level have to kill every single enemy until they are all dead.<br><br>You will meet 5 different bosses , each has his own attacks and behaviour type and before each one of them you will meet Ding in a cut-scene , he will explain the situation and what about to happen and afterwards the boss fight will begin.<br><br>As you keep going through the game , the enemies will spawn in a bigger diversity and the levels will become harder , you are expected to also encouter mirrors in the advanced levels , which reflect all of the bullets coming at them, expect spiky balls coming at you at speed trying to kill you...<br><br>Also , in an advanced level you get Ding to be a helper , he will fly by your side and shoot his ammunation when you are firing to the opposite direction , it is very helpfull in the hard levels.<br><br>Without spoiling too much of the game you are about to play , lets just say that in the end you are expected to discover something you would not expect..",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2233320/extras/1b5bb2dc12c9a2b96c8ba90448d7133a.avif?t=1671314091\" /></div><br><br>Starting with the basic info - You move with WASD , Slow motion is SHIFT and Dashing is with Q/E. Use W to activate your jetpack.<br><br>You are playing a blue robot who's been scammed to kill his own kind by a blue evil hologram named &quot;Ding&quot;, You will have to kill every single one of your robot kind until you reach the end where you discover the cruel truth.<br><br>What are you going to see in the game ? You will have to defeat hundreds of enemies , using 3 main tools , your Slow motion effect , Your jetpack and dashing. <br>In each level have to kill every single enemy until they are all dead.<br><br>You will meet 5 different bosses , each has his own attacks and behaviour type and before each one of them you will meet Ding in a cut-scene , he will explain the situation and what about to happen and afterwards the boss fight will begin.<br><br>As you keep going through the game , the enemies will spawn in a bigger diversity and the levels will become harder , you are expected to also encouter mirrors in the advanced levels , which reflect all of the bullets coming at them, expect spiky balls coming at you at speed trying to kill you...<br><br>Also , in an advanced level you get Ding to be a helper , he will fly by your side and shoot his ammunation when you are firing to the opposite direction , it is very helpfull in the hard levels.<br><br>Without spoiling too much of the game you are about to play , lets just say that in the end you are expected to discover something you would not expect..",
